			(property "Description" "Buzzer\n\nSmall round buzzers that operate around the audible 2kHz range. You can use these as speakers to create simple music or user interfaces.\n\nVariant Overview:\n\n• PTH -  https://www.sparkfun.com/products/7950 Mini Speaker - PC Mount 12mm 2.048kHz\n• PTH_KIT -  https://www.sparkfun.com/products/7950 Mini Speaker - PC Mount 12mm 2.048kHz\n\n•  KIT simplifies soldering by adding stop mask to one side of the pads.\n\n• PTH_NO_SILK -  https://www.sparkfun.com/products/7950 Mini Speaker - PC Mount 12mm 2.048kHz\n\n•  No silkscreen indicator of buzzer outline.\n\n• PTH_KIT_NO_SILK -  https://www.sparkfun.com/products/7950 Mini Speaker - PC Mount 12mm 2.048kHz\n\n•  KIT package w/o silkscreen\n\n• SMD -  Buzzer Audio Magnetic (CCV-084B16)\n\n• SMD buzzer used on, e.g. the https://www.sparkfun.com/products/8463 LilyPad Buzzer and https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9963 RFID USB Reader.\n\n• SMD_KIT -  Buzzer Audio Magnetic (CCV-084B16)\n\n• SMD Buzzer with elongated pins to make soldering easier. Used on the https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10935 SparkFun Simon Says - Surface Mount Soldering Kit."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
